WEBVTT

00:00:09,490 --> 00:00:18,210
I just had a dental composite filling which usually is a challenge for me. The procedure went well.

00:00:18,210 --> 00:00:22,770
I just wondered if there's a rife program that would help my body accept this.

00:00:27,280 --> 00:00:36,240
No, but there's rife. So when you get a filling, when you get dental work, you're always more susceptible

00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:44,080
to dental infections that could be hidden. So there's dental folk eye. There's a lot of dental

00:00:44,080 --> 00:00:49,520
programs on the rife. So if you look on the rife, there's several dental programs. The dental

00:00:49,520 --> 00:00:57,040
infection program, I would run that. So whenever you get dental work done, remember you're going to be

00:00:57,040 --> 00:01:04,800
more susceptible to or you might already have hidden dental infections. That's the problem with

00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:14,400
the root canal teeth and such. You've got the subclinical infection that is just constantly

00:01:16,720 --> 00:01:28,160
taking a toll on your immune system. So running those programs on the rife can be beneficial.

